      "widgets_values": [
        "casual snapshot. A vertical candid portrait photograph of m1tch_person, the same recognizable adult man from Pictures 1 and 3. Pictures 1 and 3 supply his face and hairline from different views; Picture 2 supplies only his lean body proportions. A vertical candid rooftop cocktail portrait at night. m1tch_person is framed from head through upper thighs in a fitted black long-sleeve button-up shirt with an open collar and a completely bare neck. His arm at image-left rests naturally on a wooden railing while that hand holds a short clear tumbler; his other hand rests in his trouser pocket at image-right. He wears a simple metal wristwatch, gives a relaxed restrained closed-lip smile, and looks slightly off-camera toward image-left. Dense city lights fill the background, with warm rooftop string lights and a few distant patrons at image-right. Natural direct phone flash, realistic hands, natural skin, and seamless nighttime integration. Keep his head through upper thighs inside the frame with natural space around the visible railing hand and tumbler. Preserve the intended trouser-pocket hand placement. He gives a relaxed restrained closed-lip smile and looks slightly off-camera toward image-left. His jaw is relaxed and his lips are gently pressed together in one continuous closed line. Give him a visibly flattering best-day appearance, about three to five years younger while retaining his distinctive adult face width, eyes, nose, mouth, ears and short brown hair and hairline. Give him a slightly stronger natural jaw and chin, raise and define his cheekbones modestly, and gently balance his face and eyelids. His eyes retain their natural size, spacing and color with clear irises and small natural catchlights. Soften forehead, eye and under-eye lines by about half, reduce under-eye puffiness and shadow, and give his skin a light bronze tan with healthy tonal variation. Keep fine visible pores and tidy individual stubble hairs. One coherent, uncaptioned and unbranded photograph with natural anatomy, skin, hair and rooftop railing, glass and nighttime city detail, and the texture of an unretouched editorial photograph."
