      "widgets_values": [
        "# RAW SOLO COCKTAIL — EXPERIMENT / ONE PASSED CASE\n\nOrdinary core nodes exposing the EXACT completed 31-node raw cocktail recipe.\nNot the public Solo v1.1 node/profile, not a universal identity lock, not a new run.\nHistorical result: prompt 53ab5112-31bd-44ad-85da-4cbe9972c804, seed315982047.\nIndependent native + thumbnail review passed; six-reference centroid.7705, minimum.5818,\nabove the unchanged.5533463954925537 floor. The public same-seed cocktail separately\nFAILED visible teeth. Do not confuse these two graphs or advertise general readiness.\n\nSAFETY: this ordinary-node graph has NO GPU-enforcement node. Root must admit an\nisolated legacy4070 experimental worker after both GPUs/queues/host RAM are checked.\nDo not queue on an arbitrary worker or overlap another owner's work. The public\nRTX3090 lock is unchanged. Loading this file is not permission to press Run.\n\nEXACT recipe: Base9B FP8, QwenFP8mixed/fullVAE, Turbo1 -> Mitch V3step1600.90 ->\nSmartphone.25, 8Euler/CFG1,832x1216. Genuine front448x592 -> body512x512 ->\nangle09 432x576, native whole-image reference latents on BOTH CFG branches.\nBody-only wording is intent, not hard conditioning separation. No face swap,\nrestoration, upscaler, output mask, crop or second pass.\n\nSeed is FIXED. Prompt, reference filenames/order/sizes, precision, scales, sampler\nand original save prefix are unchanged. SaveImage normally increments its counter;\nnever overwrite the historical photo. Changes create an UNVALIDATED variation.\nThis graph requires the three already-installed genuine inputs and existing models.\n\nKeep continuous closed lips/no teeth, slight image-left off-camera gaze, plausible\nglass grip and rail contact, natural pocket hand, coherent city/patrons and no halo.\nReview every new result at native and thumbnail size; all six genuine scores and\nthe floor remain required. This file itself was packaged without a new render.\n"
